    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in the highly sought-after Chancery Park development, this superb three-bedroom semi-detached residence offers comfortable family living in a convenient and established residential location. Ideally positioned within walking distance of Tullamore Retail Park, schools, leisure facilities, and Tullamore town centre, this property combines modern convenience with a welcoming community atmosphere. The Chancery Park development is particularly popular with families and  due to its proximity to local amenities and excellent transport links. With a private rear garden, gas-fired central heating, master en-suite and excellent local amenities on your doorstep, this property offers comfortable modern living in a highly convenient setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway:  \t\r\nWood floor\r\n\r\nSitting Room: \t\t5.80m x 5.50m\r\nWood floor, feature fireplace.\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining: \t\t5.50m x 3.64m\r\nFitted kitchen, tile floor, Double doors from kitchen/ dining to rear garden.\r\n\r\nGuest WC: \t\t1.68m x 1.26m\r\nTile floor, wc & whb  \r\n\r\nCarpeted stairs & landing with hot press off.\r\n\r\nBathroom: \t\t1.95m x 1.77m\r\nFully tiled, bath, electric shower, wc & whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\t4.25m x 3.52m\r\nCarpet floor, fitted wardrobes\r\nEnsuite: \t\t\t2.06m x 1.88m\r\nFully tiled, electric shower, wc & whb\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t3.90m x 2.90m\r\nCarpet floor, fitted wardrobes\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t3.25m x 2.46m\r\nCarpet floor, fitted wardrobes"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Three-bedroom semi-detached home \r\nSpacious main bedroom with en-suite bathroom \r\nGas-fired central heating \r\nPrivate rear garden \r\nBright and well-proportioned accommodation \r\nOff-street parking \r\nEstablished residential development \r\nWalking distance to Tullamore Retail Park \r\nClose to schools, leisure facilities and town centre \r\nIdeal family home or investment opportunity"
      },
      {
